                       "description":  "With potentially dozens of findings across multiple categories, users need robust filtering to focus on what matters. The page provides three independent filter dimensions — mode (all, actionable, needs input, resolved), severity (critical through info), and category (code bug, security, test issue, etc.). Users can combine these filters and clear them all at once. This filtering capability is essential for large reports where scanning every finding linearly would be impractical.",
