                       "description":  "Findings are not just informational — they are actionable. Users can analyze individual findings, dismiss irrelevant ones, provide input when requested, and resolve issues. The auto-fix feature is a key differentiator: users can toggle automatic fixing of eligible issues (code bugs, security, tests, documentation) and trigger a bulk fix operation that sends all auto-fixable findings to AI for resolution. This transforms the findings page from a passive report into an active issue resolution workflow.",
